---
metadata: {
    partial_name: "Dashboard | Default images",
}
---
{%- comment -%}
  Pictures for the four seeded documentation cards, used until an image is uploaded to
  each record. Called with:
    function default_images = 'dashboard/default_images'
  Returns a hash of card title to image URL. Delete it once every card has its own image.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign images = {}
  assign images['Apps'] = 'images/home/apps-img.svg' | asset_url
  assign images['Documentation'] = 'images/home/documentation-img.svg' | asset_url
  assign images['Developer Guide'] = 'images/home/guide-img.svg' | asset_url
  assign images['Liquid'] = 'images/home/liquid-img.svg' | asset_url
  return images
-%}
